:"c-shiji-111-wei-huo:p040","chapter_id":"c-shiji-111-wei-huo"},{"id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:m023-0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"郭昌","kind":"person","person_id":"ey5_pne_opn","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan:p023","chapter_id":"c-shiji-123-dayuan"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji110-125","person_id":"ey5_pne_opn","title":"拔胡將軍","kind":"office","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p048","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/110.json"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji110-125:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p048","start":205,"end":209,"surface":"拔胡將軍","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m048-0202","usage":"narrative","normalized_date":{"era":"BCE","era_year":107,"year":-106,"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"楊信既歸，漢使王烏，而單于復肴甘言，欲多得漢財物，紿謂王烏曰：「吾欲入漢見天子，面相約爲兄弟。」王烏歸報漢，漢爲單于築邸于長安。匈奴曰：「非得漢貴人使，吾不與誠語。」匈奴使其貴人至漢，病，漢予藥，欲愈之，不幸而死。而漢使路充國佩二千石印綬往使，因送其喪，厚葬直數千金，曰「此漢貴人也」。單于以爲漢殺吾貴使者，乃留路充國不歸。諸所言者，單于特空紿王烏，殊無意入漢及遣太子來質。於是匈奴數使奇兵侵犯邊。漢乃拜郭昌爲拔胡將軍，及浞野侯屯朔方以東，備胡。路充國留匈奴三歳，單于死。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p048","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/110.json"}],"references":[{"title":"《資治通鑑》平行事件","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=資治通鑑/卷021&oldid=1511468","quote":"乃拜郭昌為拔胡將軍，及浞野侯屯朔方以東，備胡","scope":"received_parallel_event","image_verified":false},{"title":"《資治通鑑》數位編輯紀年標題","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=資治通鑑/卷021&oldid=1511468","quote":"元封四年（甲戌，公元前一零七年）","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false}],"rationale":"郭昌授拔胡將軍及浞野侯屯防與通鑑同條末段相合，暫記前107年、天文年-106；多次使事連綴，不據此把段內每次出使、貴使病死或葬送都套前107年。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"basis":{"kind":"parallel_event","source_event_quote":"漢乃拜郭